WEBVTT

00:00.920 --> 00:07.592
As I stand in the wind on a hill by a port town,

00:00.920 --> 00:07.592
minatomachi oka no ue kaze wo uke

00:07.656 --> 00:14.683
mezurashii kurai atama wa karappo

00:07.656 --> 00:14.683
my head feels unusually empty.

00:15.268 --> 00:21.940
I was watching the town from the south side of the shore.

00:15.268 --> 00:21.940
haruka minami mukougishi de kono machi wo miteita

00:21.965 --> 00:28.179
And so I sunk my unsteady passion into the depths of the sea.

00:21.965 --> 00:28.179
guratsuita jounetsu wo umi ni shizumeta

00:29.073 --> 00:34.745
This surging power...

00:29.073 --> 00:34.745
tome donaku afureru chikara

00:29.073 --> 00:31.160
Black Jack

00:36.247 --> 00:42.502
It's something hidden in everyone, everywhere.

00:36.247 --> 00:42.502
sonnamono wa darenimo dokonimo hisonde iru mono

00:43.296 --> 00:48.258
Day after day, everyone tries their best.

00:43.296 --> 00:48.258
mainichi mainichi minna ganbaru

00:49.829 --> 00:57.184
But people get annoyed when I mention it.

00:49.829 --> 00:57.184
sore wo ieba hito wa mina kemutagaru

00:57.685 --> 00:59.376
Oh FREEDOM

00:59.376 --> 01:01.369
will be there

01:01.389 --> 01:04.349
It makes me glad...

01:01.389 --> 01:04.349
yokatta

01:04.594 --> 01:12.074
That I found my place here.

01:04.594 --> 01:12.074
ibasho ga koko ni attakara

01:12.127 --> 01:13.645
Oh WISDOM

01:13.645 --> 01:15.494
will be there

01:15.522 --> 01:18.163
I searched for the reason

01:15.522 --> 01:18.163
sagashita

01:18.164 --> 01:25.212
why we can believe in the same air

01:18.164 --> 01:25.212
onaji kuuki shinjirarerukoto

01:25.797 --> 01:32.677
as long as we're alive.

01:25.797 --> 01:32.677
ínochi aru kagiri

01:32.678 --> 01:34.763
He weaves the thread of life with his miraculous control of a scalpel.

01:34.847 --> 01:37.031
The genius surgeon who lives on a cape.

01:37.183 --> 01:39.794
His name is Black Jack.

01:50.324 --> 01:53.150
17th Annual Culture Festival

01:59.307 --> 02:01.834
It's just like any other festival.

02:02.727 --> 02:04.193
This one's pretty big.

02:04.394 --> 02:05.729
I found roasted squid!

02:05.730 --> 02:07.564
There's takoyaki too!

02:07.908 --> 02:10.645
Hey, you two, we're not here for fun.

02:10.819 --> 02:12.422
We're researching other culture festivals.

02:13.238 --> 02:15.406
Hey, I want some takoyaki.

02:15.407 --> 02:16.522
Two roasted squid.

02:17.492 --> 02:18.367
Sheesh!

02:22.038 --> 02:24.915
This school put more emphasis on displays.

02:24.916 --> 02:27.626
And on takoyaki too.

02:27.929 --> 02:29.294
Kumiko, do you want one too?

02:29.295 --> 02:30.462
No, thanks.

02:31.631 --> 02:33.882
You're really serious.

02:33.883 --> 02:37.010
It's all to make our culture festival a success.

02:37.303 --> 02:39.179
Can you take notes too?

02:39.833 --> 02:40.616
OK, OK.

02:40.640 --> 02:44.309
But I didn't expect you to become the head
of the festival organizing committee.

02:45.437 --> 02:46.520
What was that?

02:48.761 --> 02:49.866
What was that for?

02:49.993 --> 02:51.562
Oh, sorry.

02:51.697 --> 02:53.694
I just slipped!

02:54.646 --> 02:57.114
Please stop! Those are things we made together!

02:57.217 --> 02:58.699
You got some complaints?

02:58.757 --> 03:01.452
No, I don't. I'll be quiet.

03:02.788 --> 03:06.166
Yeah? Then we'll take what we like.

03:06.166 --> 03:07.541
What's going on?

03:07.542 --> 03:10.377
That's Jaws from Oana High.

03:10.378 --> 03:13.297
They're going wild again this year.

03:15.633 --> 03:17.324
Keep the change.

03:17.802 --> 03:19.014
Stop right there!

03:21.008 --> 03:22.473
Who are you?

03:22.734 --> 03:25.267
Give back what you just took.

03:25.424 --> 03:26.162
Yeah!

03:26.377 --> 03:27.489
What I took?

03:27.771 --> 03:29.908
But I paid money.

03:30.232 --> 03:31.503
Didn't I?

03:31.734 --> 03:33.170
Y-Yeah.

03:33.597 --> 03:34.510
See ya.

03:35.112 --> 03:36.467
W-Wait up!

03:36.655 --> 03:37.653
It's OK.

03:37.865 --> 03:40.032
OK? Aren't you upset?

03:40.033 --> 03:41.465
I am.

03:41.702 --> 03:44.579
But we never know how he'll retaliate if we defy him.

03:45.606 --> 03:46.438
Why...

03:48.916 --> 03:52.086
Originally "He Has Returned” by Tezuka Osamu

03:48.916 --> 03:52.086
Bouncer at the Culture Festival

03:54.435 --> 03:55.835
43 days to the Culture Festival

04:01.096 --> 04:02.513
Wato-san!

04:02.514 --> 04:04.474
We're about to start the festival committee meeting!

04:04.475 --> 04:06.017
Oh, right!

04:06.756 --> 04:09.749
Student Council
Conference Room

04:07.186 --> 04:13.733
For this year's festival, I want the shopping district's
shop owners to help bring more guests.

04:13.734 --> 04:17.948
But what do you intend to do about Jaws' gang?

04:18.155 --> 04:20.865
Yeah, they'll definitely make a scene.

04:21.575 --> 04:22.658
Th-That's...

04:22.659 --> 04:26.064
It's our fault that they're on the loose!

04:26.288 --> 04:29.540
But nobody can stand up to him.

04:29.757 --> 04:33.513
I heard Yamanami High in the next town got hit last week.

04:33.754 --> 04:36.695
Harukaze Academy got hit before that too.

04:43.013 --> 04:44.639
That Jaws!

04:44.640 --> 04:48.476
We should hit him, kick him, and shut him up!

04:48.477 --> 04:49.856
Yeah.

04:50.104 --> 04:55.191
But he also poses a problem for your culture festival.

04:55.192 --> 05:01.114
The upperclassmen told us that Jaws is notorious
around here for ruining culture festivals.

05:01.657 --> 05:03.533
A culture festival crasher, huh?

05:03.681 --> 05:04.768
Don't worry!

05:04.868 --> 05:08.079
I won't let them do as they wish!

05:08.350 --> 05:09.455
Yeah!

05:09.456 --> 05:12.646
They can't do that as long as you have us!

05:13.050 --> 05:14.683
Kazashimo Festival

05:19.466 --> 05:22.802
This is more boring than Yamanami
High from the other day.

05:22.803 --> 05:23.501
Hey!

05:23.985 --> 05:25.513
You again?!

05:25.514 --> 05:28.516
Leave what you took from our students!

05:28.892 --> 05:33.187
Take them back if you want 'em so bad, big sissy.

05:33.188 --> 05:35.940
What?! Damn you!

05:35.941 --> 05:36.774
There!

05:43.966 --> 05:44.719
Let's go.

05:50.122 --> 05:52.665
Jaws showed up at Kazashimo High, too.

05:52.666 --> 05:55.293
Yeah, I heard it was horrible.

05:55.294 --> 05:57.503
Will our festival be OK?

05:57.504 --> 05:58.960
I'm worried.

06:02.592 --> 06:05.466
Thank you for your help.

06:05.596 --> 06:06.647
Thank you.

06:06.960 --> 06:07.746
No problem.

06:08.841 --> 06:10.494
We've been to so many stores already.

06:10.851 --> 06:14.061
But I'm glad there're so many people willing to help.

06:14.062 --> 06:15.269
Naturally!

06:15.606 --> 06:18.733
It's all because two pretty ladies
are asking them face-to-face.

06:20.694 --> 06:21.694
See you tomorrow!

06:21.695 --> 06:22.403
Yeah.

06:23.697 --> 06:26.240
Come on, are you done already?

06:27.493 --> 06:29.744
Now show us what you got in your pockets!

06:29.745 --> 06:31.832
Hey! What are you doing?!

06:32.247 --> 06:33.289
Captain!

06:34.041 --> 06:36.000
It's finally the captain's turn, huh?

06:36.001 --> 06:37.085
Damn it.

06:42.007 --> 06:44.133
Hey, she's serious.

06:57.689 --> 06:58.649
Come on.

07:20.921 --> 07:24.158
Is this all the captain of the kendo team got?

07:40.357 --> 07:42.358
What's up? Got more left in you?

07:43.152 --> 07:48.156
What's so fun about bullying weak people, you coward?!

07:48.699 --> 07:49.817
What?!

07:50.117 --> 07:51.707
You call me a coward?!

07:52.202 --> 07:53.661
Say it again!

07:53.662 --> 07:58.082
You are a scumbag who gives Oana High a bad name!

08:01.170 --> 08:02.241
Damn bitch!

08:02.636 --> 08:04.088
I'll shut you up!

08:16.560 --> 08:17.351
Jaws!

08:18.211 --> 08:19.444
Oh shit!

08:18.578 --> 08:19.445
Let's go.

08:20.985 --> 08:24.772
It's a case of cardiac infarction caused
by congental coronary stenosis.

08:25.986 --> 08:29.447
Don't just stand there! Save my son!

08:29.448 --> 08:32.366
He's in a very dangerous situation.

08:32.670 --> 08:35.495
I'll sue you if anything happens to him!

08:35.496 --> 08:37.402
There's only so much I can do.

08:37.649 --> 08:39.935
We'll pay as much as you need!

08:41.627 --> 08:43.894
This is not a matter of money.

08:45.589 --> 08:47.048
He's in critical condition.

08:47.049 --> 08:50.715
His parents said that they'll pay as much
as needed if we can save him.

08:51.136 --> 08:52.804
Hey, wait a minute.

08:52.972 --> 08:54.263
Please!

08:54.264 --> 08:56.292
The patient is a high school kid.

08:56.975 --> 09:00.520
He's a notorious delinquent, known as Jaws.

09:01.434 --> 09:02.123
Jaws?

09:02.147 --> 09:03.707
Anyway, please hurry here.

09:08.179 --> 09:12.826
We are performing coronary revascularization
using an internal mammary artery graft.

09:13.700 --> 09:15.034
Now Commencing operation.

09:21.166 --> 09:22.333
Inject heparin.

09:23.252 --> 09:26.879
Blood pressure is 80/40. It's dropping.

09:26.880 --> 09:28.464
Increase the dopamine injection.

09:28.465 --> 09:29.674
Prepare artificial heart-lung.

09:29.675 --> 09:30.591
OK.

09:36.265 --> 09:38.182
Is it true that Jaws fell ill?

09:38.183 --> 09:41.477
Yeah, but he miraculously survived.

09:41.478 --> 09:43.396
He should stay in the hospital forever!

09:43.397 --> 09:47.024
Yeah, I don't want him to come back.

09:50.654 --> 09:52.796
When can I get outta here?

09:54.658 --> 09:56.576
You got wads of money already, didn't you?

09:56.577 --> 09:58.536
Then get me well already, Quack Doc.

09:59.997 --> 10:02.498
I can let you go if you're doing so well.

10:02.499 --> 10:03.374
Seriously?

10:03.375 --> 10:04.500
Yeah!

10:04.918 --> 10:09.107
But from now on, you must avoid aggressive
exercise or getting overly excited.

10:09.882 --> 10:12.216
I can't guarantee your life if you don't.

10:14.219 --> 10:15.428
Don't try to scare me.

10:16.180 --> 10:18.272
I'm not joking or trying to scare you.

10:18.807 --> 10:21.309
I heard you like going wild,

10:21.310 --> 10:23.394
so if you get excited and get into a fight again,

10:24.062 --> 10:26.355
your heart will most definitely stop.

10:27.024 --> 10:27.933
W-What?

10:33.030 --> 10:34.281
<i>His heart...</i>

10:37.095 --> 10:38.644
Bad news!

10:37.095 --> 10:38.644
14 days to the Culture Festival

10:38.869 --> 10:40.912
Jaws is back!

10:41.962 --> 10:42.615
He is?!

10:43.122 --> 10:44.603
Jaws is back?

11:08.890 --> 11:11.567
Please don't bother our festival anymore.

11:12.694 --> 11:15.012
We haven't done anything yet.

11:15.090 --> 11:17.532
We are all troubled by you!

11:17.533 --> 11:18.449
Yeah!

11:18.575 --> 11:22.370
Your presence alone is interfering with our work!

11:22.371 --> 11:23.503
What?!

11:26.455 --> 11:28.900
If you get excited and get into a fight again,

11:29.294 --> 11:31.856
your heart will most definitely stop.

11:36.277 --> 11:36.924
Let's go!

11:37.845 --> 11:39.303
Wait up, Jaws!

11:39.328 --> 11:40.495
Shopping District

11:47.229 --> 11:49.323
Hey, Jaws, aren't they...

11:50.107 --> 11:53.151
I-I thought you were in the hospital!

11:53.316 --> 11:55.551
I'm doing fine, as you can see.

11:55.904 --> 11:56.748
Move.

11:56.989 --> 11:58.136
Outta my way!

12:01.076 --> 12:02.960
Jaws? What's wrong?

12:03.954 --> 12:05.079
Hey!

12:05.080 --> 12:06.873
Shit! Run!
What's going on there?!

12:19.261 --> 12:20.333
Damn!

12:28.687 --> 12:31.355
What do you want, calling me out here so late?

12:31.857 --> 12:34.324
Jaws, we talked this over.

12:34.568 --> 12:36.569
We won't have anything to do with you from now on.

12:36.865 --> 12:37.904
What?

12:37.905 --> 12:41.032
The others are looking down on us because of you!

12:41.033 --> 12:42.617
We can't stand it

12:48.040 --> 12:49.134
What a pussy!

12:49.354 --> 12:50.181
We're outta here.

12:50.327 --> 12:51.221
Later.

13:01.762 --> 13:03.137
It's all because of you!

13:03.466 --> 13:09.647
Every time I worry about my body, I can't stay cool!

13:10.062 --> 13:12.850
It's all because you told me that bluff!

13:13.232 --> 13:15.890
My comrades left me because of that, too.

13:16.235 --> 13:17.318
Now what?!

13:17.319 --> 13:18.552
It's not surprising.

13:19.363 --> 13:22.532
In a herd of monkeys, sick monkeys get kicked out too.

13:23.033 --> 13:24.071
What?!

13:24.558 --> 13:25.410
Listen to me.

13:25.411 --> 13:28.359
I'm a doctor, so I told you the truth.

13:28.831 --> 13:31.958
Or do you want me to lie to you and
tell you that you're all better

13:31.959 --> 13:33.584
so you can do anything you want now?

13:33.585 --> 13:34.735
Why, you!

13:35.314 --> 13:37.647
Come on, get more angry!

13:37.860 --> 13:39.465
You'll die just like that!

13:42.136 --> 13:46.264
Doctor, isn't there anything you can do about my body?

13:46.265 --> 13:48.307
Nope, nothing.

13:51.437 --> 13:53.657
I want to live cool.

13:53.939 --> 13:56.858
But now my body's like this.

13:57.651 --> 13:59.708
How should I live...

14:01.405 --> 14:03.197
What a spoiled kid.

14:03.198 --> 14:04.574
What?!

14:04.575 --> 14:07.118
Trouble about your body! Trouble about your gang!

14:07.119 --> 14:09.120
But you don't try to do anything on your own!

14:09.121 --> 14:10.098
You're just a brat!

14:14.042 --> 14:15.768
Think carefully about

14:16.378 --> 14:20.089
what it means to live a cool life.

14:24.762 --> 14:27.930
What do you think of the haunted house I designed?

14:27.931 --> 14:30.475
This is what my sister's class is going to have!

14:30.476 --> 14:33.603
You really don't get tired of this stuff, huh?

14:34.772 --> 14:36.229
We're sorry!

14:36.523 --> 14:39.150
Why, you!

14:39.385 --> 14:41.277
Look at this!

14:41.278 --> 14:43.613
Man, this won't be cheap.

14:44.031 --> 14:46.991
Hey, it's your fault too.

14:46.992 --> 14:49.619
Yeah! You weren't paying attention either!

14:49.803 --> 14:50.995
What?

14:50.996 --> 14:52.971
You little brat!

14:53.040 --> 14:54.457
Hey, you guys.

14:57.268 --> 14:59.629
That's Oana High's Jaws!

14:59.630 --> 15:02.006
Damn! We'll leave you alone for today!

15:02.549 --> 15:05.227
Thanks for saving us.

15:05.469 --> 15:07.574
I didn't do anything.

15:07.888 --> 15:08.693
Hey...

15:09.741 --> 15:10.514
Um...

15:11.475 --> 15:16.145
Why don't you choose another lifestyle
if you can't live like before?

15:16.522 --> 15:17.608
What?

15:18.399 --> 15:21.693
Like doing good things for other people.

15:22.152 --> 15:25.488
Like helping out the culture festival.

15:26.073 --> 15:26.948
Shut up!

15:27.366 --> 15:28.783
Don't meddle with my mind.

15:43.966 --> 15:46.467
D-Do you need something?

15:46.927 --> 15:49.114
I don't really need anything.

15:49.638 --> 15:52.338
I thought I'd protect the festival.

15:52.641 --> 15:56.118
Nobody can come and mess with us if I'm around.

15:56.723 --> 15:57.645
Quit lying!

15:57.646 --> 15:59.063
You must be up to something else!

15:59.064 --> 16:00.897
Yeah! We can't trust you!

16:01.108 --> 16:02.175
Wait.

16:02.860 --> 16:06.320
I think we should trust him.

16:06.321 --> 16:07.478
Wato-san...

16:07.781 --> 16:11.425
Besides, we get a good deal if he's our guard.

16:11.660 --> 16:13.369
But that's...

16:13.370 --> 16:14.829
He must be up to something!

16:16.123 --> 16:17.248
Yeah?

16:17.249 --> 16:18.420
Oh well.

16:19.168 --> 16:21.787
I'll just do it on my own.

16:28.973 --> 16:30.636
Please stop!

16:30.637 --> 16:33.556
Why? Let's go have some fun.

16:33.557 --> 16:34.766
Hey, look!

16:34.767 --> 16:36.006
J-Jaws!

16:39.396 --> 16:40.688
Come on. Let's go!

16:43.901 --> 16:46.069
He helped us?

16:46.070 --> 16:47.213
I guess so.

16:47.320 --> 16:50.320
Oana High School
Culture Festival

17:17.111 --> 17:18.944
Final Day
Culture Festival

18:00.144 --> 18:02.895
Thank you for coming!

18:06.108 --> 18:09.793
Thank you there, moustache man and bandage boy!

18:18.472 --> 18:19.212
Um...

18:21.192 --> 18:22.232
What you got?

18:23.292 --> 18:25.258
We wanted to show our gratitude.

18:25.961 --> 18:29.088
Looks like this culture festival will end without trouble.

18:29.339 --> 18:30.673
Thank you!

18:31.383 --> 18:34.010
We're about to have the closing party in the gym.

18:34.011 --> 18:35.396
Please come to that too.

18:37.931 --> 18:39.748
I'm not that type.

18:40.393 --> 18:43.574
But you should! We appreciate what you did!

18:44.480 --> 18:46.981
Please come, even if it's just at the end.

18:48.817 --> 18:50.234
And here.

18:51.570 --> 18:52.918
I forgot to give them back to you before.

19:06.668 --> 19:08.252
Hey, Jaws.

19:10.062 --> 19:13.043
Since when do you like looking at flowers?

19:16.136 --> 19:17.216
What do you want?

19:17.513 --> 19:19.013
Don't you know?

19:19.014 --> 19:21.182
We came to see you.

19:21.183 --> 19:24.185
And we'll ruin the festival, too.

19:24.485 --> 19:27.406
I dare you to take one more step.

19:27.856 --> 19:29.148
I'll stop you all.

19:47.626 --> 19:51.379
You know well how strong I am.

20:09.719 --> 20:11.519
Hey! We have trouble!

20:11.608 --> 20:13.317
What's the matter, Pinoco-chan?

20:13.578 --> 20:17.280
Jaws is fighting against a whole bunch of guys at the gate!

20:17.865 --> 20:18.906
What?!

20:28.208 --> 20:30.209
I-is he dead?!

20:30.210 --> 20:32.545
It's not our fault!

20:33.255 --> 20:34.008
Jaws!

20:36.675 --> 20:38.824
Man, this is such an uncool way to die.

20:39.230 --> 20:43.014
Come on! You won't die so easily!

20:45.990 --> 20:46.670
Jaws!

20:47.290 --> 20:47.917
Jaws!

20:48.937 --> 20:51.088
Jaws! Jaws!

21:03.360 --> 21:04.007
Scalpel.

21:05.067 --> 21:05.620
Here.

21:25.849 --> 21:27.225
He already left.

21:27.893 --> 21:28.941
But...

21:29.269 --> 21:32.814
He was transferred to a hospital outside
of town for better rehabilitation.

21:35.312 --> 21:36.312
I see.

21:38.404 --> 21:42.048
Doing good things for ether people
actually feels pretty good.

21:43.325 --> 21:46.160
I'll take up your challenge again when I return.

21:46.161 --> 21:47.128
You better be ready.

21:49.873 --> 21:50.709
He's...

22:10.561 --> 22:17.567
I want to capture your heart with my silly smile.

22:10.561 --> 22:17.567
itazura no hohemi de muchuu ni sasetaino

22:17.568 --> 22:24.740
Only look straight at me.

22:17.568 --> 22:24.740
massugu na kimi no me ni watashi wo utsushitene

22:24.785 --> 22:32.042
Being kind isn't good enough.

22:24.785 --> 22:32.042
yasashii dake dewa nanika tarinaino

22:32.043 --> 22:42.552
I want to get in touch with your true heart, deep
within the you that nobody else sees.

22:32.043 --> 22:42.552
dare nimo misenai kokoro no oku no sotto furetai

22:42.553 --> 22:47.933
Being in the gentle sunlight,

22:42.553 --> 22:47.933
yawaraka na hizashi abite

22:47.934 --> 22:57.317
I wish on the clover that plays the melody of dreams,

22:47.934 --> 22:53.139
yume wo kanaderu clover

22:53.594 --> 22:57.318
kaze ni negai wo nosete

22:57.318 --> 23:08.078
and I search for a ray of hope beyond the blue skies,

22:57.318 --> 23:08.078
aoi sora no mukou e kibou no hikari sagasuno

23:08.079 --> 23:13.166
because I want to stay by your side forever.

23:08.079 --> 23:13.166
zutto soba ni itakara

23:13.167 --> 23:26.137
The promise we made long ago in a far away place...

23:13.167 --> 23:26.137
haruka kanata de zutto mae kara

23:26.138 --> 23:33.061
is finally coming to a realization, overcoming the incredible distance,

23:26.138 --> 23:33.061
hikari ni terasare michibikareru youni

23:33.062 --> 23:43.947
just as it was lead by the light.

23:33.062 --> 23:36.995
sora no hate tooku

23:37.088 --> 23:43.888
toki wo koete ima tadori tsuku

23:45.141 --> 24:15.143
The Violin in the Snowy Field

23:45.141 --> 23:48.641
The note that's once played
will never disappear.

23:53.208 --> 23:54.623
When is the rescue coming?!

23:56.188 --> 23:56.904
Pinoco!

23:59.342 --> 24:01.202
My violin! I must go get it!

24:01.242 --> 24:03.315
It's my life!

24:04.145 --> 24:07.392
All I can hear are the screams
that your fingers are making.

24:07.518 --> 24:11.431
You must not let go of the most prized thing.

24:11.472 --> 24:14.338
Next Karte - The Violin in the Snowy Field.

24:15.811 --> 24:17.413
Karte NG...

24:22.637 --> 24:24.624
What? That's our fault?
